.idea
allure-results
sauronFiles
target
# Chrome user-data dirs / browser profiles (never commit these)
profiles/
**/profiles/
# Chrome junk that can leak in even outside profiles/
**/Crashpad/
**/SingletonLock
**/SingletonCookie
**/SingletonSocket
*.crashpad

runtime_data.json
.jenkins.env
.jenkins.env.*

# Local secrets for the production sanity suite, read by run-prod-sanity.sh/.ps1. NEVER commit.
# The tracked template is .env.prod.example, which must stay empty. CI does not use these -
# Jenkins binds the credential to PROD_MONITOR_PASSWORD directly.
.env
.env.*
!.env.prod.example
allure-report/

# Generated QA analysis outputs (not source)
TEST_COVERAGE_ANALYSIS.*
MERGED_TEST_EXECUTION_REPORT.xlsx
saved-reports/

# Captured API traces and curl transcripts. These are debugging scratch, and they routinely
# contain live bearer tokens copied straight out of a run - ci/check-secrets.js found three
# real JWTs in API_TRACE_DOC.md. Keep them local; never commit them.
API_TRACE_DOC.*
*_CURLS.md
*_CURL.md
